@.str.22460 = private unnamed_addr constant [178 x i8] c"'inline' and 'simd' cannot both be applied to one function \E2\80\94 'simd' replaces the function with a CPU-dispatching stub, which is exactly the opaque call 'inline' asks to remove\00"
